decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Julio-Olalla-1-400x284.jpg\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Julio-Olalla-1.jpg 479w, https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Julio-Olalla-1-400x284.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" class=\"wp-image-105840\" \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"et_overlay\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"et_pb_gallery_item et_pb_grid_item et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_gallery_item_13_5\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class='et_pb_gallery_image landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Tania-Labbe-de-IST-1.jpg\" title=\"Tania Labb\u00e9 de IST\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Tania-Labbe-de-IST-1-400x284.jpg\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Tania-Labbe-de-IST-1.jpg 479w, https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Tania-Labbe-de-IST-1-400x284.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" class=\"wp-image-105841\" \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"et_overlay\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"et_pb_gallery_pagination\"><\/div><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>13\/08\/2026 Fuimos parte de un Encuentro Significativo junto a Julio Olalla Con gran orgullo organizamos y fuimos parte de un Encuentro Significativo junto a Julio Olalla, pionero mundial del coaching ontol\u00f3gico y presidente de Newfield Network. Se trat\u00f3 de una actividad especial destinada a reflexionar sobre liderazgo, el impacto de las conversaciones y el cuidado [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":32,"featured_media":105835,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_et_pb_use_builder":"on","_et_pb_old_content":"","_et_gb_content_width":""},"categories":[14,12,1],"tags":[],"acf":[],"jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Encuentro-con-Julio-Olalla-scaled.jpg","jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/105348"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/32"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=105348"}],"version-history":[{"count":7,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/105348\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":105843,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/105348\/revisions\/105843"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/105835"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=105348"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=105348"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=105348"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":105307,"date":"2026-08-12T12:22:39","date_gmt":"2026-08-12T15:22:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/?p=105307"},"modified":"2026-08-12T12:22:45","modified_gmt":"2026-08-12T15:22:45","slug":"fortaleciendo-el-cuidado-de-la-vida-en-encuentro-de-comites-paritarios-de-universidad-de-valparaiso","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/fortaleciendo-el-cuidado-de-la-vida-en-encuentro-de-comites-paritarios-de-universidad-de-valparaiso\/","title":{"rendered":"Fortaleciendo el cuidado de la vida en Encuentro de Comit\u00e9s Paritarios de Universidad de Valpara\u00edso"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_14 et_section_regular\" >\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_14\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_14  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_14  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">12\/08\/2026<\/p>\n<h1>Fortaleciendo el cuidado de la vida en Encuentro de Comit\u00e9s Paritarios de Universidad de Valpara\u00edso <\/h1>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"wp-image-105309 aligncenter size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Foto-Grupal-2-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Foto-Grupal-2-980x735.jpg 980w, https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Foto-Grupal-2-480x360.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 1024px, 100vw\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Fuimos parte del Encuentro de Comit\u00e9s Paritarios de Higiene y Seguridad de la Universidad de Valpara\u00edso, que tuvo como prop\u00f3sito fortalecer la gesti\u00f3n preventiva y promover espacios de trabajo m\u00e1s seguros, saludables y sostenibles.<\/p>\n<p>La jornada se desarroll\u00f3 como un espacio de aprendizaje, colaboraci\u00f3n e intercambio de experiencias, permitiendo a las y los participantes expandir sus conocimientos y compartir buenas pr\u00e1cticas en materia de seguridad y salud en el trabajo.<\/p>\n<p>La actividad cont\u00f3 con la participaci\u00f3n de Christian Corval\u00e1n, vicerrector de Gesti\u00f3n Institucional de la universidad, quien destac\u00f3 la importancia del trabajo colaborativo y el compromiso permanente junto a IST.<\/p>\n<p>Durante el encuentro se abordaron los principales contenidos del Curso de Orientaci\u00f3n para Comit\u00e9s Paritarios, de acuerdo con lo establecido en el Decreto Supremo N.\u00b0 44, y como parte de la jornada, las y los representantes de los comit\u00e9s tambi\u00e9n participaron en un ejercicio pr\u00e1ctico enfocado en la elaboraci\u00f3n de un programa de trabajo.<\/p>\n<p>Este tipo de iniciativas reafirma nuestro compromiso para la generaci\u00f3n de entornos laborales con foco en el cuidado de la vida.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_gallery et_pb_gallery_14  et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_gallery_grid\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_gallery_items et_post_gallery clearfix\" data-per_page=\"4\"><div class=\"et_pb_gallery_item et_pb_grid_item et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_gallery_item_14_0\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class='et_pb_gallery_image landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Foto-Grupal.jpg\" title=\"Foto Grupal\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Foto-Grupal-400x284.jpg\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Foto-Grupal.jpg 479w, https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Foto-Grupal-400x284.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" class=\"wp-image-105310\" \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"et_overlay\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"et_pb_gallery_item et_pb_grid_item et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_gallery_item_14_1\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class='et_pb_gallery_image landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Entrega-de-Diplomas.jpg\" title=\"Entrega de Diplomas\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Entrega-de-Diplomas-400x284.jpg\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Entrega-de-Diplomas.jpg 479w, https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Entrega-de-Diplomas-400x284.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" class=\"wp-image-105311\" \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"et_overlay\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"et_pb_gallery_item et_pb_grid_item et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_gallery_item_14_2\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class='et_pb_gallery_image landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Ximena-Cerpa-scaled.jpg\" title=\"Ximena Cerpa\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Ximena-Cerpa-400x284.jpg\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Ximena-Cerpa-scaled.jpg 479w, https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Ximena-Cerpa-400x284.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" class=\"wp-image-105312\" \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"et_overlay\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"et_pb_gallery_item et_pb_grid_item et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_gallery_item_14_3\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class='et_pb_gallery_image landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Entrega-de-diplomas-2.jpg\" title=\"Entrega de diplomas 2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Entrega-de-diplomas-2-400x284.jpg\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Entrega-de-diplomas-2.jpg 479w, https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Entrega-de-diplomas-2-400x284.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" class=\"wp-image-105313\" \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"et_overlay\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"et_pb_gallery_item et_pb_grid_item et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_gallery_item_14_4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class='et_pb_gallery_image landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href