t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>03\/08\/2026 Con gran \u00e9xito participamos en Congreso Latinoamericano de Coaching ICF Chile 2026 Con gran \u00e9xito participamos en el Congreso Latinoamericano de Coaching ICF Chile 2026, realizado el 31 de julio y 1 de agosto en la Universidad T\u00e9cnica Federico Santa Mar\u00eda, Sede San Joaqu\u00edn, en Santiago. El encuentro, organizado por ICF Chile, reuni\u00f3 a [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":32,"featured_media":105052,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_et_pb_use_builder":"on","_et_pb_old_content":"","_et_gb_content_width":""},"categories":[14,12,1],"tags":[],"acf":[],"jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Tania-Labbe.jpg","jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/105042"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/32"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=105042"}],"version-history":[{"count":7,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/105042\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":105067,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/105042\/revisions\/105067"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/105052"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=105042"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=105042"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=105042"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":104880,"date":"2026-07-29T18:31:38","date_gmt":"2026-07-29T21:31:38","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/?p=104880"},"modified":"2026-07-29T18:31:43","modified_gmt":"2026-07-29T21:31:43","slug":"damos-la-bienvenida-a-mk-recursos-humanos","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/damos-la-bienvenida-a-mk-recursos-humanos\/","title":{"rendered":"\u00a1Damos la bienvenida a MK Recursos Humanos!"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_17 et_section_regular\" >\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_17\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_17  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_17  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">29\/07\/2026<\/p>\n<h1>\u00a1Damos la bienvenida a MK Recursos Humanos!<\/h1>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"wp-image-104884 aligncenter size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Bienvenida-a-MK-Recursos-Humanos-1024x768.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Bienvenida-a-MK-Recursos-Humanos-980x735.jpeg 980w, https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Bienvenida-a-MK-Recursos-Humanos-480x360.jpeg 480w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 1024px, 100vw\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Dimos la bienvenida a MK Recursos Humanos SpA como nuevo adherente, incorporando a m\u00e1s de 700 trabajadores y trabajadoras a nivel nacional.<\/p>\n<p>La actividad marc\u00f3 el inicio de una alianza orientada a fortalecer la gesti\u00f3n preventiva y promover una cultura de seguridad y bienestar, basada en el trabajo colaborativo y el acompa\u00f1amiento t\u00e9cnico que nos caracteriza.<\/p>\n<p>Esta incorporaci\u00f3n representa un nuevo paso en el compromiso compartido de ambas organizaciones por impulsar una gesti\u00f3n preventiva integral, que sit\u00fae a las personas en el centro y promueva el bienestar como un eje estrat\u00e9gico.<\/p>\n<p>Con esta alianza reafirmamos nuestro prop\u00f3sito de acompa\u00f1ar a las empresas adherentes en la construcci\u00f3n de espacios de trabajo donde la prevenci\u00f3n, el cuidado y la calidad de vida laboral sean pilares fundamentales para el \u00e9xito organizacional.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_gallery et_pb_gallery_17  et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_gallery_grid\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_gallery_items et_post_gallery clearfix\" data-per_page=\"4\"><div class=\"et_pb_gallery_item et_pb_grid_item et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_gallery_item_17_0\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class='et_pb_gallery_image landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Bienvenida-a-MK-Recursos-Humanos.jpeg\" title=\"Bienvenida a MK Recursos Humanos\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Bienvenida-a-MK-Recursos-Humanos-400x284.jpeg\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Bienvenida-a-MK-Recursos-Humanos.jpeg 479w, https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Bienvenida-a-MK-Recursos-Humanos-400x284.jpeg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" class=\"wp-image-104884\" \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"et_overlay\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"et_pb_gallery_pagination\"><\/div><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>29\/07\/2026 \u00a1Damos la bienvenida a MK Recursos Humanos! Dimos la bienvenida a MK Recursos Humanos SpA como nuevo adherente, incorporando a m\u00e1s de 700 trabajadores y trabajadoras a nivel nacional. La actividad marc\u00f3 el inicio de una alianza orientada a fortalecer la gesti\u00f3n preventiva y promover una cultura de seguridad y bienestar, basada en el [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":32,"featured_media":104884,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_et_pb_use_builder":"on","_et_pb_old_content":"","_et_gb_content_width":""},"categories":[14,12,1],"tags":[],"acf":[],"jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Bienvenida-a-MK-Recursos-Humanos.jpeg","jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/104880"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/32"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=104880"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/104880\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":104887,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/104880\/revisions\/104887"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/104884"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=104880"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=104880"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=104880"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":104193,"date":"2026-07-22T18:39:30","date_gmt":"2026-07-22T21:39:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/?p=104193"},"modified":"2026-07-22T18:45:26","modified_gmt":"2026-07-22T21:45:26","slug":"firmamos-acuerdo-con-hospital-dr-eduardo-pereira-que-fortalece-gestion-preventiva","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/firmamos-acuerdo-con-hospital-dr-eduardo-pereira-que-fortalece-gestion-preventiva\/","title":{"rendered":"Firmamos acuerdo con Hospital Dr. Eduardo Pereira que fortalece gesti\u00f3n preventiva"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_18 et_section_regular\" >\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_18\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_18  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">22\/07\/2026<\/p>\n<h1>Firmamos acuerdo con Hospital Dr. Eduardo Pereira que fortalece gesti\u00f3n preventiva<\/h1>\n<p>Junto al Hospital Dr. Eduardo Pereira firmamos un protocolo de colaboraci\u00f3n para la implementaci\u00f3n del Sistema de Acreditaci\u00f3n (SAC Inicial) del Comit\u00e9 Paritario de Higiene y Seguridad (CPHS).<\/p>\n<p>Esta iniciativa busca consolidar una gesti\u00f3n preventiva m\u00e1s s\u00f3lida al interior del establecimiento de salud, impulsando el desarrollo del comit\u00e9 paritario.<\/p>\n<p>La implementaci\u00f3n del proceso contar\u00e1 con nuestro acompa\u00f1amiento t\u00e9cnico, asesor\u00eda especializada y capacitaciones, lo que permitir\u00e1 fortalecer las competencias del comit\u00e9 paritario y promover una cultura organizacional centrada en la prevenci\u00f3n de accidentes del trabajo y enfermedades profesionales.<\/p>\n<p>La firma del protocolo fue encabezada por la directora (s) del Hospital Dr. Eduardo Pereira, Dra. Daniela Siegmund; la presidenta del Comit\u00e9 Paritario de Higiene y Seguridad, Nicoll Mu\u00f1oz Goic; y el gerente de Empresas Estrat\u00e9gicas Servicios de Salud del IST, Ren\u00e9 Pizarro Garrido.<\/p>\n<p>Con esta alianza reforzamos nuestro compromiso con ambientes laborales m\u00e1s seguros, promoviendo una gesti\u00f3n preventiva y sostenible que contribuya al cuidado de las personas.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_gallery et_pb_gallery_18  et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_gallery_grid\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_gallery_items et_post_gallery clearfix\" data-per_page=\"4\"><div class=\"et_pb_gallery_item et_pb_grid_item et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_gallery_item_18_0\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class='et_pb_gallery_image landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Firma-de-protocolo-1.jpg\" title=\"Firma de protocolo\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Firma-de-protocolo-1-400x284.jpg\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Firma-de-protocolo-1.jpg 479w, https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Firma-de-protocolo-1-400x284.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" class=\"wp-image-104196\" \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"et_overlay\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"et_pb_gallery_item et_pb_grid_item et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_gallery_item_18_1\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class='et_pb_gallery_image landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Firma-entre-IST-y-hospital.jpg\" title=\"Firma entre IST y hospital\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Firma-entre-IST-y-hospital-400x284.jpg\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Firma-entre-IST-y-hospital.jpg 479w, https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Firma-entre-IST-y-hospital-400x284.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" class=\"wp-image-104197\" \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"et_overlay\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"et_pb_gallery_item et_pb_grid_item et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_gallery_item_18_2\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class='et_pb_gallery_image landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Firma.jpg\" title=\"Firma\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"284\" src=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Firma-400x284.jpg\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Firma.jpg 479w, https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Firma-400x284.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" class=\"wp-image-104198\" \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"et_overlay\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"et_pb_gallery_pagination\"><\/div><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>22\/07\/2026 Firmamos acuerdo con Hospital Dr. Eduardo Pereira que fortalece gesti\u00f3n preventiva Junto al Hospital Dr. Eduardo Pereira firmamos un protocolo de colaboraci\u00f3n para la implementaci\u00f3n del Sistema de Acreditaci\u00f3n (SAC Inicial) del Comit\u00e9 Paritario de Higiene y Seguridad (CPHS). Esta iniciativa busca consolidar una gesti\u00f3n preventiva m\u00e1s s\u00f3lida al interior del establecimiento de salud, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":32,"featured_media":104204,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_et_pb_use_builder":"on","_et_pb_old_content":"","_et_gb_content_width":""},"categories":[14,12,1],"tags":[],"acf":[],"jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Firma-entre-IST-y-hospital...jpg","jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/104193"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/32"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=104193"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/104193\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":104208,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/104193\/revisions\/104208"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/104204"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=104193"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=104193"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=104193"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":103841,"date":"2026-07-14T14:52:49","date_gmt":"2026-07-14T17:52:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/?p=103841"},"modified":"2026-07-14T14:52:53","modified_gmt":"2026-07-14T17:52:53","slug":"reporte-sostenibilidad-2025","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/reporte-sostenibilidad-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Reporte Sostenibilidad 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_19 et_section_regular\" >\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_19\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_19  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_19  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h1><span style=\"color: #800080;\"><b>Reporte de Sostenibilidad IST 2025<\/b><\/span><\/h1><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_20  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>La sostenibilidad se ha consolidado como un pilar esencial en la gesti\u00f3n de las organizaciones, a trav\u00e9s del enfoque ESG, que integra criterios ambientales (E), sociales (S) y de gobernanza (G). En este contexto, los reportes de sostenibilidad se han convertido en una herramienta clave para transparentar el desempe\u00f1o de las instituciones.<\/p>\n<p>En IST llevamos una d\u00e9cada elaborando reportes de sostenibilidad. Para su elaboraci\u00f3n, utilizamos la metodolog\u00eda del Global Reporting Initiative (GRI), que nos permite organizar la informaci\u00f3n de forma clara, comparable y centrada en los temas m\u00e1s relevantes para la organizaci\u00f3n y sus grupos de inter\u00e9s.<\/p>\n<p>Adem\u00e1s, incorporamos est\u00e1ndares SASB (Sustainability Accounting Standards Board), que proporcionan informaci\u00f3n sobre riesgos y oportunidades que podr\u00edan afectar la sostenibilidad de las organizaciones en el mediano y largo plazo<\/p>\n<p>Tambi\u00e9n somos parte del Pacto Global de Naciones Unidas desde el a\u00f1o 2012. Esto se relaciona directamente con nuestro compromiso con los Objetivos de Desarrollo Sostenible (ODS), en especial con el ODS 3 (Salud y Bienestar) y el ODS 8 (Trabajo Decente y Crecimiento Econ\u00f3mico), que mantienen una relaci\u00f3n directa con los servicios que entregamos.<\/p>\n<p>En esta secci\u00f3n encontrar\u00e1 nuestros reportes de sostenibilidad. El reporte correspondiente al a\u00f1o 2025 incluye 60 indicadores tanto GRI como SASB que documentan el desempe\u00f1o y los avances de nuestro compromiso.<\/p>\n<p>Los invitamos a conocer nuestro reporte de sostenibilidad 2025:<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_0\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Reporte-de-sostenibilidad-2025.pdf\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap \"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1275\" height=\"1650\" src=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Portada-Reporte-de-sostenibilidad-2025.jpg\" alt=\"\" title=\"Portada Reporte de sostenibilidad 2025\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Portada-Reporte-de-sostenibilidad-2025.jpg 1275w, https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Portada-Reporte-de-sostenibilidad-2025-980x1268.jpg 980w, https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Portada-Reporte-de-sostenibilidad-2025-480x621.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 1275px, 100vw\" class=\"wp-image-103843\" \/><\/span><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div><div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_20\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_20  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_0_wrapper  et_pb_module \">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"et_pb_button et_pb_button_0 et_pb_bg_layout_light\" href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Reporte-de-sostenibilidad-2024.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Reporte Sostenibilidad 2024<\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><div class=\"et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_1_wrapper  et_pb_module \">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"et_pb_button et_pb_button_1 et_pb_bg_layout_light\" href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/Reporte-Sustentabilidad-IST-2020.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Reporte Sostenibilidad 2020<\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div><div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_21  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_2_wrapper  et_pb_module \">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"et_pb_button et_pb_button_2 et_pb_bg_layout_light\" href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Reporte-de-sostenibilidad-2023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Reporte Sostenibilidad 2023<\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><div class=\"et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_3_wrapper  et_pb_module \">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"et_pb_button et_pb_button_3 et_pb_bg_layout_light\" href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/Reporte-de-Sustentabilidad-2019-IST.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Reporte Sostenibilidad 2019<\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div><div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_22  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_4_wrapper  et_pb_module \">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"et_pb_button et_pb_button_4 et_pb_bg_layout_light\" href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Reporte-Sostenibilidad-2022.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Reporte Sostenibilidad 2022<\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><div class=\"et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_5_wrapper  et_pb_module \">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"et_pb_button et_pb_button_5 et_pb_bg_layout_light\" href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Reporte-de-sostenibilidad-2018.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Reporte Sostenibilidad 2018<\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div><div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_23  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_6_wrapper  et_pb_module \">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"et_pb_button et_pb_button_6 et_pb_bg_layout_light\" href=\"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Reporte-Sostenibilidad-IST-2021.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Reporte Sostenibilidad 2021<\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Reporte de Sostenibilidad IST 2025La sostenibilidad se ha consolidado como un pilar esencial en la gesti\u00f3n de las organizaciones, a trav\u00e9s del enfoque ESG, que integra criterios ambientales (E), sociales (S) y de gobernanza (G). En este contexto, los reportes de sostenibilidad se han convertido en una herramienta clave para transparentar el desempe\u00f1o de las [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":11,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_et_pb_use_builder":"on","_et_pb_old_content":"","_et_gb_content_width":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"acf":[],"jetpack_featured_media_url":"","jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/103841"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/11"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=103841"}],"version-history":[{"count":7,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/103841\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":103850,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/103841\/revisions\/103850"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=103841"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=103841"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ist.cl\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=103841"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}]